The page clock steps the `requestAnimationFrame` counter, but not your CSS keyframes. Right after `goto`, pause and seek them:

```js
await page.evaluate(ms => {
  for (const a of document.getAnimations()) { a.pause(); a.currentTime = ms; }
  const s = getComputedStyle(document.querySelector('.hero'));
  return { opacity: s.opacity, transform: s.transform };
}, t);
```
Repeat for each t, alongside `page.clock.runFor(t)` for the counter.
